    "text": {
     "en": "A mela has rows of stalls selling toys, bangles, sweets and balloons.\nThere may be handicrafts, clay pots and handmade things from villages.\nPeople pay money to buy things. We should plan what to buy and not spend all our money.\nLook carefully at prices and choose things we really need.\nThere may be rides, magic shows and folk dances too."
